<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Attempts to clip through walls using the Yungblud Happier Jump emote.

=-Requirements-=
-A Wall thats less than 1 stud thick

=-How to use-=
-Go up against a wall and have your back against the wall. Also have your camera facing the wall.
-Use Macro</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 55 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 55 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyDown 30 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 30 1
Delay 1 ms
Delay 260 ms
KeyDown 26 1
KeyDown 225 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 1 s
KeyUp 225 1
Delay 1 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>